Package: com.appknox.appstorectl
Name: appstorectl
Version: 1.0.0
Architecture: iphoneos-arm64
Description: Buy and install App Store apps from the shell. Hands an ASDPurchase to appstored over XPC and lets Apple's own pipeline do the purchase, download, FairPlay binding and install. Ships with AutoConfirmSheet, a tweak that dismisses only the App Store purchase-confirmation sheet so installs need no interaction.
Maintainer: vinay
Author: vinay
Section: Utilities
Depends: ellekit, com.autopear.installipa, zip
